Yes—good catch. This is exactly the Terraform change you want.

Because your backend pods run in EKS and RDS is private, RDS must allow traffic from the EKS worker node security group on port 5432.

Here’s how to do it cleanly.

1. Open your Terraform project

From Git Bash:

cd ~/Ecommerce-Devops-Project

Find your RDS/security group files:

Common names:

ls

You may have:

main.tf
rds.tf
eks.tf
security-groups.tf
variables.tf

2. Find existing RDS security group

You probably already have something like:

resource "aws_security_group" "rds_sg" {
  name   = "rds-sg"
  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id
}

and RDS attached:

resource "aws_db_instance" "postgres" {
  ...
  vpc_security_group_ids = [aws_security_group.rds_sg.id]
}

3. Find EKS node security group

Depending on how you created EKS.

You may have:

resource "aws_eks_node_group" "nodes" {

or module output.

Sometimes node SG:

aws_security_group.eks_nodes.id

Example:

resource "aws_security_group" "eks_nodes" {
  name   = "eks-node-sg"
  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id
}

4. Add inbound rule to RDS

Best practice = separate SG rule resource.

Add:

resource "aws_security_group_rule" "allow_eks_to_rds" {
  type                     = "ingress"

  from_port                = 5432
  to_port                  = 5432
  protocol                 = "tcp"

  security_group_id        = aws_security_group.rds_sg.id

  source_security_group_id = aws_security_group.eks_nodes.id

  description              = "Allow PostgreSQL from EKS worker nodes"
}

Meaning:

EKS worker node SG
        ↓
RDS SG
        ↓
5432 allowed

That’s ideal.

If you used EKS module

Sometimes SG comes from module output:

Example:

module "eks" {
  ...
}

Then use:

resource "aws_security_group_rule" "allow_eks_to_rds" {
  type                     = "ingress"

  from_port                = 5432
  to_port                  = 5432
  protocol                 = "tcp"

  security_group_id        = aws_security_group.rds_sg.id

  source_security_group_id = module.eks.node_security_group_id
}

5. Validate

Run:

terraform plan

Expected:

+ aws_security_group_rule.allow_eks_to_rds

Then:

terraform apply

Type:

yes

